Thanks [~accountid:712020:61ca3c26-7f48-41c2-aa17-30a61b99b569] - my thoughts are as follows:

{quote}*_Rider Complaints:_* _A driver is requesting that we provide him all the complaints riders made against him and the outcomes of them. I am unsure if he should be allowed insight into them, or their outcomes as may categorize them as business sensitive information?_{quote}

So technically these complaints would count as the driver’s personal data, but in order to consider whether an exemption applies it would be useful to see the complaints themselves. As such, could you get CS to source all complaints made by riders against this driver and then we can consider? Please note:

* If CS are having trouble finding these complaints, loop in someone from the local Safety team and see if they can assist.
* We should interpret their request as specific and formal complaints made by riders about the driver to Bolt CS / Safety. This should not include complaints raised by third parties (e.g., local license authorities) unless those complaints originated from a rider.

{quote}*_Driver Complaints:_* _A driver also wants the outcomes of all the complaints he made against the riders, this I would also categorize as sensitive business information._{quote}

* Same advice as above - Let’s see what information we are dealing with first, then we can consider.
* One extra thing to flag is that, unlike rider complaints, the driver will be fully aware of these already as the driver issued the complaints. As such, it may be more difficult for us to withhold these from the driver entirely.

{quote}*_Rating and Reviews:_* _This driver is blocked so I can provide him with the rating from admin but for the reviews (I am assuming he means comments) we would reject that as it contains the information of third party._{quote}

* We can provide both ratings and comments, provided these are anonymised. See the ratings / comments information that I prepare for each Bulk DSAR response. If you have any questions on how I prepare these, let me know and I can talk you through it.

{quote}*_Total amount of trip:_* _I can provide that._{quote}

* Agreed.

