Thank you for your data subject rights request, which we received on 22 December 2024. Please find our response below.

*(1) Copy of your personal data*

After conducting a diligent search for records relating to your access request, we have confirmed that you have an active Bolt account and we do process the personal data requested. Data protection law entitles individuals to a copy of their personal data within the search scope – that is personal data, which identifies them, or enables them to be identified from it as a living individual person. 

As you may be aware, the right of access under data protection law does not provide an individual with an absolute right of full access to any and all documents containing their personal data. For example, the law requires a data controller such as ourselves to protect the rights of third parties (including the rights of drivers and Bolt employees). Furthermore, we must point out that we are not required to disclose documents or otherwise provide you with access to certain documentation where an exemption applies.

We therefore attach a copy of your personal data processed by Bolt, to which you are entitled.

