* Details of any transfer of your personal data to third countries or international organisations and the safeguards used for any such transfers.

Please also note the following:

* Bolt may share your personal data with the following recipients or categories of recipints:
** Drivers for the provision of transport services;
** Bolt Group of Companies and partners;
