We can then do a query via Postman to {{http://node.live.boltint.net/route-prediction/adminPanel/getTripState}} using this the following request to get the {{route-prediction}} trip state ({color:#bf2600}*beware that the trip state expires after 4 hours, so there’s a limited time window in which you can get this data*{color}).{color:#bf2600} {color}

