{quote}Am I correct that the new service line of debit cards will work in the way that Business customers (entities) link their debit cards to Bolt and top up the balance? If yes, what specific help with the services will MQ provide?{quote}

Nope, Bolt is issuing the cards (cards are Bolt branded), and for this, we are partnering with MQ - [https://www.marqeta.com|https://www.marqeta.com|smart-link] 

{quote}Can you please help me understand what specific 'embedded finance services' we provide in this example?{quote}

Embedded Finance Service essentially mean that our drivers have an integrated wallet to store and transfer their money from. When they register as drivers, they also accept AWX T&Cs and the privacy notice and have an independent relationship with them. Bolt integrates the wallet functionality in the Driver App. AWX is the manager is the wallet - if the driver wanted to, they could separately log into their wallet on the [AWX website|https://www.airwallex.com/eu]. 

